At that time, the Bible was not yet divided into chapters and verses.

794
01:33:01.986 --> 01:33:07.986
So if you said, you need to read that section, you had to give a little quote from there.

795
01:33:07.986 --> 01:33:08.986
And that is what Jesus does here.

796
01:33:15.986 --> 01:33:18.986
And then he mentions Isaiah 65.

797
01:33:20.986 --> 01:33:21.986
And Jeremiah 7.

798
01:33:23.986 --> 01:33:25.986
He overturns those phases.

799
01:33:32.986 --> 01:33:36.986
We can't read it all now, but you should really read it at some point.

800
01:33:43.986 --> 01:33:50.986
And he actually quotes here about entering that outer court of the temple.

801
01:34:02.986 --> 01:34:10.986
And here Isaiah actually says that when non-Jews come in to worship,

802
01:34:10.986 --> 01:34:14.986
then I will provide for that to be possible.

803
01:34:17.986 --> 01:34:21.986
And to make that possible, that is what the outer court was made for.

804
01:34:22.986 --> 01:34:30.986
It was huge, but they filled it with tables and money tables and money changers and cows and dust.

805
01:34:30.986 --> 01:34:32.986
And it was completely blocked.

806
01:34:43.986 --> 01:34:46.986
And so He does not find what God designed.

807
01:34:51.986 --> 01:34:54.986
Let us read Isaiah 56, 6 and 7.

808
01:34:57.986 --> 01:34:59.986
This is God through Isaiah.

809
01:34:59.986 --> 01:35:13.986
He says, and foreigners, so again, non-Jews, foreigners who have joined themselves to the Lord to serve Him,

810
01:35:15.986 --> 01:35:17.986
and to love the name of the Lord,

811
01:35:18.986 --> 01:35:20.986
and to be servants of the Lord,

812
01:35:21.986 --> 01:35:29.986
and everyone who keeps the Sabbath and does not profane it, everyone who holds fast to my covenant,

813
01:35:33.986 --> 01:35:36.986
I will bring them to my holy mountain.

814
01:35:39.986 --> 01:35:42.986
Temple, Jerusalem, holy mountain, all the same.

815
01:35:43.986 --> 01:35:45.986
I will let them come.

816
01:35:45.986 --> 01:35:53.986
He says, and give them joy in my house of prayer.

817
01:35:54.986 --> 01:36:03.986
Their offerings will be accepted on my altar.

818
01:36:03.986 --> 01:36:10.986
For my temple shall be called a house of prayer for all nations.

819
01:36:10.986 --> 01:36:15.986
This is what God designed it for.

820
01:36:17.986 --> 01:36:23.986
So on this day, Jesus walks in there, and then He seeks something.

821
01:36:25.986 --> 01:36:29.986
He wants to see that it is as God designed it to be.

822
01:36:31.986 --> 01:36:35.986
In the temple, on the temple mount, what was it about then?

823
01:36:36.986 --> 01:36:39.986
Bringing offerings, worship,

824
01:36:42.986 --> 01:36:45.986
worship and prayer directed to the Lord.

825
01:36:50.986 --> 01:36:54.986
And He says here, you are making something entirely different from what it was intended to be.

826
01:36:56.986 --> 01:37:01.986
You have completely strayed from what is truly to be done.

827
01:37:01.986 --> 01:37:07.986
You should have helped the other nations to worship me.

828
01:37:09.986 --> 01:37:12.986
And instead of helping them, you hinder them.

829
01:37:15.986 --> 01:37:18.986
Your worship is in the way.

830
01:37:20.986 --> 01:37:22.986
That is not a good position to be in.

831
01:37:25.986 --> 01:37:28.986
So open church, what is that place about?

832
01:37:28.986 --> 01:37:30.986
What is the temple about?

833
01:37:31.986 --> 01:37:33.986
What is the house about?

834
01:37:34.986 --> 01:37:35.986
Why do you come in here?

835
01:37:36.986 --> 01:37:37.986
Why do we come here?

836
01:37:38.986 --> 01:37:39.986
To be distracted?

837
01:37:42.986 --> 01:37:45.986
Or do we come prepared to bring an offering?

838
01:37:46.986 --> 01:37:48.986
For it remains the same.

839
01:37:49.986 --> 01:37:50.986
Nothing changes.

840
01:37:50.986 --> 01:37:54.986
The Lord comes in and says, you are making something of it that it is not.

841
01:37:57.986 --> 01:38:01.986
And the main design of God's house,

842
01:38:03.986 --> 01:38:05.986
is a place to seek Him,

843
01:38:06.986 --> 01:38:07.986
to worship Him,

844
01:38:08.986 --> 01:38:09.986
to pray

845
01:38:10.986 --> 01:38:11.986
and to seek His face,

846
01:38:12.986 --> 01:38:13.986
to know His will

847
01:38:14.986 --> 01:38:15.986
and to do it as well.

848
01:38:17.986 --> 01:38:18.986
If we do not do that,

849
01:38:18.986 --> 01:38:20.986
then we are not doing well.

850
01:38:29.986 --> 01:38:32.986
Jerusalem is the house, it is the throne of worship.

851
01:38:34.986 --> 01:38:36.986
And He will be worshiped there.

852
01:38:38.986 --> 01:38:41.986
To the ends of the earth it will continue.

853
01:38:43.986 --> 01:38:46.986
But when He returns, will He come to nothing?

854
01:38:47.986 --> 01:38:48.986
To no worship?

855
01:38:50.986 --> 01:38:51.986
He will be worshiped.

856
01:38:52.986 --> 01:38:53.986
He will surely be worshiped.

857
01:38:57.986 --> 01:39:02.986
Jerusalem is also the seat of judgment.

858
01:39:09.986 --> 01:39:11.986
And that threshing floor, that is the temple,

859
01:39:12.986 --> 01:39:14.986
that is the place where Ornan was threshing.

860
01:39:17.986 --> 01:39:19.986
There grain was threshed.

861
01:39:23.986 --> 01:39:26.986
That is actually a flattened piece of ground,

862
01:39:28.986 --> 01:39:29.986
in a circular shape.

863
01:39:36.986 --> 01:39:38.986
And when the Lord then says to David,

864
01:39:39.986 --> 01:39:43.986
this exact place, there you must build an altar for my sacrifice.

865
01:39:44.986 --> 01:39:47.986
Then David comes there and it turns out to be a threshing floor.

866
01:39:53.986 --> 01:39:57.986
And when you see a threshing floor mentioned in the Bible,

867
01:39:58.986 --> 01:40:00.986
it always refers to making a separation.

868
01:40:02.986 --> 01:40:03.986
About judgment.

869
01:40:05.986 --> 01:40:06.986
God will make a separation.

870
01:40:08.986 --> 01:40:10.986
God will judge between nations.

871
01:40:11.986 --> 01:40:13.986
He will separate peoples.

872
01:40:16.986 --> 01:40:17.986
Those who are grain.

873
01:40:19.986 --> 01:40:21.986
And separate the chaff from the wheat.

874
01:40:23.986 --> 01:40:24.986
The righteous.

875
01:40:26.986 --> 01:40:27.986
And the wicked.

876
01:40:32.986 --> 01:40:33.986
And then in Luke 3

877
01:40:36.986 --> 01:40:37.986
John the Baptist says about Jesus

878
01:40:38.986 --> 01:40:40.986
the following words. Pay attention.

879
01:40:45.986 --> 01:40:46.986
The people were full of expectation.

880
01:40:50.986 --> 01:40:53.986
And they wondered in their hearts, could John be the Messiah?

881
01:40:59.986 --> 01:41:01.986
And John said to them, I baptize you with water,

882
01:41:02.986 --> 01:41:04.986
but there comes someone who is much more powerful than I.

883
01:41:08.986 --> 01:41:12.986
And I am not even worthy to untie the straps of his sandals.

884
01:41:16.986 --> 01:41:19.986
And he will baptize you with the Holy Spirit and with fire.

885
01:41:24.986 --> 01:41:27.986
And then he says in his hand,

886
01:41:29.986 --> 01:41:30.986
he holds the winnowing fork in his hand,

887
01:41:31.986 --> 01:41:33.986
to clear his threshing floor.

888
01:41:41.986 --> 01:41:43.986
And to gather the grain into his barn.

889
01:41:47.986 --> 01:41:48.986
And he will, who is he?

890
01:41:50.986 --> 01:41:51.986
Jesus, right?

891
01:41:54.986 --> 01:41:56.986
He, Jesus, will burn the chaff with unquenchable fire.

892
01:42:01.986 --> 01:42:05.986
And in this way, but also many other examples,

893
01:42:05.986 --> 01:42:09.986
he tried to urge the people and proclaimed to them the good news.

894
01:42:13.986 --> 01:42:14.986
Jesus returns to Jerusalem.

895
01:42:18.986 --> 01:42:19.986
And Palm Sunday is the down payment on that.

896
01:42:22.986 --> 01:42:23.986
It is the first time.

897
01:42:25.986 --> 01:42:26.986
He will come a second time.

898
01:42:31.986 --> 01:42:33.986
And he will not come as the lamb anymore.

899
01:42:35.986 --> 01:42:36.986
But he will come as the judge.

900
01:42:38.986 --> 01:42:39.986
He will come as king.

901
01:42:44.986 --> 01:42:49.986
He will judge in such a way that the thousand-year reign of peace can begin then.

902
01:42:51.986 --> 01:42:52.986
The throne is there.

903
01:42:54.986 --> 01:42:56.986
The throne of judgment, the seat of judgment.

904
01:42:57.986 --> 01:43:01.986
And in Matthew 25, Jesus speaks about this himself.

905
01:43:05.986 --> 01:43:08.986
He says, when I return in my glory, I will sit on my throne.

906
01:43:09.986 --> 01:43:10.986
In Jerusalem.

907
01:43:15.986 --> 01:43:18.986
I will gather all the other nations around me.

908
01:43:26.986 --> 01:43:36.986
And he says, and then I will, as a shepherd does, separate the goats from the sheep.

909
01:43:39.986 --> 01:43:41.986
And it is time to be set apart.

910
01:43:42.986 --> 01:43:43.986
It is time for the kingdom.

911
01:43:45.986 --> 01:43:48.986
It is time for righteousness to fill the whole earth.

912
01:43:52.986 --> 01:43:53.986
Jerusalem is that city.

913
01:43:54.986 --> 01:43:55.986
Why do I say this?

914
01:44:07.986 --> 01:44:14.986
And I say this because it is important that we see on Palm Sunday that Jesus enters Jerusalem there.

915
01:44:14.986 --> 01:44:17.986
But we also see that Jesus returns there again.

916
01:44:18.986 --> 01:44:24.986
And that he says, I will deliver Jerusalem from those who attack Jerusalem.

917
01:44:26.986 --> 01:44:33.986
But in Revelation 19, he does not come on a donkey, but on a white horse.

918
01:44:38.986 --> 01:44:42.986
And he comes back as the warrior, as the Messiah, as the warrior.

919
01:44:45.986 --> 01:44:46.986
When you think of Jerusalem.

920
01:44:48.986 --> 01:44:50.986
First of all, think of him.

921
01:44:55.986 --> 01:44:59.986
Do not think other thoughts first, but think first of the Messiah, Jesus.

922
01:45:09.986 --> 01:45:16.986
Do not think about the conflict that is ongoing, but think about the Bible, what it says about this being the seat of His government.

923
01:45:18.986 --> 01:45:26.986
And warfare serves only to remind you that He is coming back.

924
01:45:29.986 --> 01:45:31.986
The real warfare is about that King.

925
01:45:38.986 --> 01:45:44.986
And it is about that King who is coming back to rule all the nations of the world.

926
01:45:44.986 --> 01:45:48.986
And not everyone is happy about a Jewish King coming.

927
01:45:51.986 --> 01:45:54.986
But He will remove wicked governments.

928
01:45:57.986 --> 01:46:01.986
And He will let the righteous holy take those places.

929
01:46:02.986 --> 01:46:03.986
Are you ready for that?

930
01:46:05.986 --> 01:46:08.986
The second coming, the return of Jesus, is coming.

931
01:46:10.986 --> 01:46:13.986
And He says, then I will look for the faithful.

932
01:46:14.986 --> 01:46:20.986
Those who have sincerely followed me through their life journey.

933
01:46:22.986 --> 01:46:25.986
And as King, I will reward them for that.

934
01:46:26.986 --> 01:46:27.986
With myself.

935
01:46:27.986 --> 01:46:28.986
To be with me.

936
01:46:29.986 --> 01:46:30.986
To do my will.

937
01:46:31.986 --> 01:46:32.986
To renew the planet.

938
01:46:34.986 --> 01:46:38.986
To let the glory of God fill all the earth.

939
01:46:40.986 --> 01:46:41.986
This is good news.

940
01:46:42.986 --> 01:46:43.986
Okay, let's pray.

941
01:46:44.986 --> 01:46:45.986
Shall we stand together?

942
01:47:02.986 --> 01:47:06.986
Warfare should serve as a reminder for us, as a reminder.

943
01:47:07.986 --> 01:47:08.986
Do not fall asleep.

944
01:47:09.986 --> 01:47:11.986
When you should be in prayer.

945
01:47:12.986 --> 01:47:13.986
That is what he actually says.

946
01:47:20.986 --> 01:47:23.986
You are sleeping at the moment when I need you to pray with me.

947
01:47:32.986 --> 01:47:37.986
Jesus wants his people, his church, to be awake in the moments just before he returns.

948
01:47:39.986 --> 01:47:42.986
And we pray for his return.

949
01:47:46.986 --> 01:47:49.986
And we pray that his will be done on earth.

950
01:47:53.986 --> 01:47:55.986
This is the most important role of this house.

951
01:47:58.986 --> 01:47:59.986
Let us pray.

952
01:48:02.986 --> 01:48:03.986
Lord, we thank you for your Word.

953
01:48:05.986 --> 01:48:06.986
That shows your plan.

954
01:48:09.986 --> 01:48:12.986
We do not come up with a plan, you have had a plan for a long time.

955
01:48:15.986 --> 01:48:18.986
You ask us to eat it and then to pray it out.

956
01:48:21.986 --> 01:48:23.986
You ask of us to stir up our spirit.

957
01:48:25.986 --> 01:48:26.986
And that we have oil with us.

958
01:48:29.986 --> 01:48:30.986
A fresh understanding.

959
01:48:32.986 --> 01:48:34.986
A renewed revelation of the Scriptures.

960
01:48:38.986 --> 01:48:41.986
And if we do not do that, then everything becomes too vague.

961
01:48:48.986 --> 01:48:51.986
So Lord, make us a house of prayer.

962
01:48:56.986 --> 01:49:01.986
We are the temple with your own Spirit, you have access to God's Spirit 24 hours a day.

963
01:49:08.986 --> 01:49:13.986
You want to pour out your Spirit in a greater way than even Acts 2.

964
01:49:24.986 --> 01:49:28.986
And I pray that we will be caught in flames again.

965
01:49:28.986 --> 01:49:33.986
And I pray that we will be rekindled in fire and flame.

966
01:49:42.986 --> 01:49:47.986
And as we think about how you entered this city next week,

967
01:49:47.986 --> 01:49:50.986
let us remember that you are coming back to that city.

968
01:49:58.986 --> 01:50:10.986
And Lord, what do you expect of me in the meantime before you, to prepare for your return,

969
01:50:10.986 --> 01:50:14.986
so that I will be connected to your throne and to your plan of what you are going to do.

970
01:50:17.986 --> 01:50:20.986
He has said, stay awake, be vigilant.

971
01:50:24.986 --> 01:50:27.986
People of God, do not fall asleep, but be vigilant.

972
01:50:29.986 --> 01:50:35.986
Do not only watch how events unfold,

973
01:50:36.986 --> 01:50:37.986
but come to me.

974
01:50:38.986 --> 01:50:39.986
Come to my Word.

975
01:50:42.986 --> 01:50:44.986
Come to my Spirit to pray,

976
01:50:46.986 --> 01:50:47.986
so that you can be filled.

977
01:50:52.986 --> 01:50:56.986
So that you will also have understanding of the things of the day in which you live.

978
01:50:56.986 --> 01:50:58.986
So renew us Lord,

979
01:50:59.986 --> 01:51:00.986
renew each one of us.

980
01:51:02.986 --> 01:51:04.986
If you do not know the Lord this morning,

981
01:51:07.986 --> 01:51:09.986
and you want Him to save you,

982
01:51:11.986 --> 01:51:13.986
He has already paid the price for your life.

983
01:51:15.986 --> 01:51:17.986
He has already paid the ransom.

984
01:51:18.986 --> 01:51:21.986
He has overcome your life of sin and bad things.

985
01:51:29.986 --> 01:51:31.986
But today is the day to be set free from that.

986
01:51:34.986 --> 01:51:36.986
So Lord, if that is you,

987
01:51:36.986 --> 01:51:38.986
just come to the Lord and say,

988
01:51:38.986 --> 01:51:40.986
Lord Jesus, save me.

989
01:51:40.986 --> 01:51:44.986
If you feel addressed by this, say to the Lord,

990
01:51:44.986 --> 01:51:45.986
Jesus, save me.

991
01:51:49.986 --> 01:51:51.986
Come and fill me with your spirit.

992
01:51:52.986 --> 01:51:53.986
And make me yours.

993
01:51:56.986 --> 01:51:57.986
Fill me with your spirit,

994
01:51:59.986 --> 01:52:00.986
so that I can truly see you,

995
01:52:03.986 --> 01:52:04.986
so that I can worship you,

996
01:52:06.986 --> 01:52:08.986
so that I can fully obey you.

997
01:52:10.986 --> 01:52:11.986
Amen.

998
01:52:12.986 --> 01:52:13.986
Thank you, Lord.

999
01:52:41.986 --> 01:52:42.986
Tomorrow there is prayer,

1000
01:52:42.986 --> 01:52:46.986
but let us be in reflection of this Easter week.

1001
01:52:46.986 --> 01:52:47.986
Is that a good idea?

1002
01:52:47.986 --> 01:52:48.986
We can close our eyes.

1003
01:52:48.986 --> 01:52:50.986
I want to conclude this service with prayer.

1004
01:52:50.986 --> 01:52:51.986
Hallelujah.

1005
01:52:51.986 --> 01:52:52.986
Thank you, Jesus,

1006
01:52:52.986 --> 01:52:55.986
for what you did for us 2000 years ago.

1007
01:52:56.986 --> 01:52:57.986
And thank you, Lord,

1008
01:52:57.986 --> 01:53:00.986
that by your stripes we are healed.

1009
01:53:00.986 --> 01:53:02.986
By your blood we are forgiven.

1010
01:53:03.986 --> 01:53:05.986
By your death we do not have to die.

1011
01:53:05.986 --> 01:53:08.986
And by your resurrection we have risen

1012
01:53:08.986 --> 01:53:11.986
as saved children of God.

1013
01:53:11.986 --> 01:53:13.986
And Lord, I want to pray once again

1014
01:53:13.986 --> 01:53:15.986
that we will enter the week

1015
01:53:15.986 --> 01:53:18.986
and that we will feel the weight of it,

1016
01:53:18.986 --> 01:53:19.986
and I dare even to say

1017
01:53:19.986 --> 01:53:22.986
that we will feel the emotion of it this week,

1018
01:53:22.986 --> 01:53:24.986
what Jesus has done for us.

1019
01:53:24.986 --> 01:53:26.986
I pray this with...

1020
01:53:26.986 --> 01:53:28.986


1021
01:53:28.986 --> 01:53:30.986
I am serious about this.

1022
01:53:30.986 --> 01:53:32.986
Lord, let me say it for myself.

1023
01:53:32.986 --> 01:53:34.986
Lord, I want to feel it in my emotions.

1024
01:53:35.986 --> 01:53:37.986
I want to feel it in my emotions.

1025
01:53:37.986 --> 01:53:40.986
I want, like the two brothers who walk on that road,

1026
01:53:40.986 --> 01:53:43.986
when I think of Jesus, I want my heart to be on fire.

1027
01:53:43.986 --> 01:53:46.986
I want to feel it with my emotions.

1028
01:53:46.986 --> 01:53:49.986
Lord, give me this feeling through your Holy Spirit.

1029
01:53:49.986 --> 01:53:52.986
And so I send us all into this week.

1030
01:53:52.986 --> 01:53:54.986
In the mighty name of Jesus

1031
01:53:54.986 --> 01:53:57.986
may the Lord bless you and protect you.

1032
01:53:57.986 --> 01:53:59.986
